alue="<?=e($data['title'])?>" required></div><div class="field"><label for="hero_image">Hero image path</label><input id="hero_image" name="hero_image" value="<?=e($data['hero_image'])?>" placeholder="media/images/..."><small>Faqat mavjud media path yoki ishonchli URL.</small></div><div class="field wide"><label for="intro">Intro</label><textarea id="intro" name="intro" rows="5"><?=e($data['intro'])?></textarea></div><div class="guide"><strong>Contact data</strong><p>Telefon, email, manzil va boshqa mavjud kontakt fieldlarini JSON object/array sifatida saqlang. Uydirma kontakt ma’lumotlari kiritmang.</p></div><div class="field wide"><label for="contact">Contact JSON</label><textarea id="contact" name="contact" rows="12" spellcheck="false" placeholder='{"phone":"...","email":"...","address":"..."}'><?=e(jsonText($data['contact']))?></textarea></div><div class="guide"><strong>Social links</strong><p>Faqat rasmiy va tasdiqlangan ijtimoiy tarmoq URL’larini kiriting.</p></div><div class="field wide"><label for="social">Social JSON</label><textarea id="social" name="social" rows="10" spellcheck="false" placeholder='{"instagram":"...","telegram":"...","facebook":"..."}'><?=e(jsonText($data['social']))?></textarea><small>Valid JSON object/array. Bo‘sh qoldirish mumkin.</small></div></div><div class="actions"><div class="hint">JSON UTF-8 · pretty-print · LOCK_EX · CSRF protected · zero dependencies.</div><button class="save" type="submit">SAVE CHANGES →</button></div></form><p class="footer">data/aloqa.json · PHP 8.x · current contact/social fields preserved.</p></main></div></body></html>